---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms"
  description="Model Cost figures are estimates from catalog rates, not an invoice or a quote from a model vendor."
>
  <main id="main" class="shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Terms</p>
    <h1>How to read the numbers.</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Model Cost is a free estimator. The figures on these pages are not a
        bill, not a quote from Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, xAI, or OpenRouter,
        and not a guarantee of what you will be charged.
      </p>
      <p>
        Token counts for Claude, Gemini, and Grok are labeled estimates. GPT
        uses tiktoken in this browser; that count can still differ from a
        production API if the model or tokenizer changes.
      </p>
      <p>
        Rates are catalog prices per million tokens, shown on the
        <a href="/rates">rates</a> page. Vendors change prices. Cached or
        last-verified dates can lag. INR display uses a fixed conversion for
        the page, not a live FX feed.
      </p>
      <p>
        You are responsible for how you use the tools and for checking the
        vendor’s own pricing before you spend. The site is provided as-is, with
        no warranty that the math or rates are complete or current.
      </p>
      <p>
        Do not paste secrets you would not want sitting in a browser tab. See
        also <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
